Held while Proven - For Tilers 1.0 is in App Review.

The reseed rewrites the demo account that App Review signs into: it closes
open shifts and moves every date onto today. Running it mid-review makes the
app look like it changes under the reviewer, which is how 1.0 drew a 5.6.

Delete this file once the app is approved, or once review has its own account
that scripts/seed-demo.mjs never touches.
